  "description": "Rev C Portaflex Channel One Normal jack through the 6SL7 stages and passive Bass/Treble network to the Ext. Amp node. The Rev C 6SL7 paraphase inverter drives a fixed-bias 6L6GC pair. The internal 8 \u03a9 speaker is reflected to the feedback winding by its turns ratio.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
